            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0294" n="200" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg200"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.00 Commission of Investigation/132:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Hoover to
                        the Chairman of the President’s Commission</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Forbes</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-03-08">March 8, 1930</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I concur entirely in the recommendation set forth in your telegram No. 1 of March
                    7.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert Hoover</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
